Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1052] End of Wano 01 - New Morning.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.46,0:01:30.04,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew\NSubtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.09,0:01:33.59,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1700,409)}Holy Land of\NMary Geoise\NRed Line
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.92,0:01:37.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So Nika...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.51,0:01:42.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...has finally emerged.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.14,0:01:46.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I can scarcely believe\Ntwo Emperors of the Sea fell at the same time...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.11,0:01:54.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We cannot suppress\Nknowledge of these events.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.32,0:01:57.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The news will spread\Naround the world almost instantly.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.24,0:01:59.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The timing could not be any worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.49,0:02:01.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How do we approach this?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.28,0:02:04.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,With respect to Zou...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.59,0:02:15.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it true that Zou disappeared?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.13,0:02:19.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes...\NGradually, into the fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.22,0:02:22.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But what could that mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.02,0:02:27.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That they will not open the borders!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.89,0:02:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Land of Wano remains\Nan impregnable fortress!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.81,0:02:35.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Perhaps they have adapted\Ntheir strategies to the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.86,0:02:37.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They appear to be under\Ncapable leadership.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:43.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then overrunning the country\Nthrough force of numbers is impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.87,0:02:49.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is retrieving Nico Robin...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.33,0:02:51.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...still within your ability?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:52.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.13,0:02:59.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,CP-0! CP-0!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.51,0:03:03.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A jamming signal?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.31,0:03:06.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.10,0:03:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.27,0:03:14.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stay right where you are!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.65,0:03:19.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm comin' to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.58,0:03:30.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Land of Wano,\Nfreed from twenty years of tyranny,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.79,0:03:33.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,celebrates the victory of the Kozuki Clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.22,0:03:47.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drake...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.72,0:03:48.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.56,0:03:51.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...a marine?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.52,0:03:53.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You expect me to answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.81,0:03:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You came here to ask me that?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.95,0:04:04.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You look like you've been\Nto hell and back...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.04,0:04:13.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I thought you predicted you'd be safe...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.71,0:04:16.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,as long as you didn't betray Kaido...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.55,0:04:26.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,When I saw that beast before me,\NI knew I was a dead man walking,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.72,0:04:29.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and so I became Kaido's subordinate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.18,0:04:32.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kid and Killer, on the other hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.23,0:04:36.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,continued to resist...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.61,0:04:41.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...despite certain death!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.74,0:04:50.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even if I had foreseen their victory...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.62,0:04:55.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could I...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.12,0:04:59.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How could I ever return to Kid after all this time,\Ntail between my legs?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:12.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So you weren't talking about me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.10,0:05:14.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That one percent thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.40,0:05:22.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Then the fortune you told\Nfor a "certain man" was...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.07,0:05:31.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.34,0:05:45.34,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1568,349)}7 days\Nafter\Nthe Great\NSky Battle\NOver the\NLand of\NWano
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.88,0:05:50.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.09,0:05:54.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nay, I am not!\NSamurai do not want for food!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.77,0:05:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.85,0:05:56.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.02,0:05:59.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't take down the Fire Festival\Ndecorations just yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:02.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,By declaration of Momonosuke-sama,\Nour Lord, the Shogun,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.07,0:06:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we are to hold another festival!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.23,0:06:04.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:06.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.45,0:06:12.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Starting today,\NI'll be teaching this class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.28,0:06:14.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is Miss Sarahebi gone?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.83,0:06:15.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whyzzat?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:21.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sorry, but you'll all need to forget\Neverything she's taught you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.63,0:06:26.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I will be re-educating you\Non the entire history of our heroes!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:26.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whuuuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.47,0:06:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We dun wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:28.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We dun wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.35,0:06:35.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why don't we start\Nwith a fine fellow, Kozuki Oden!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.68,0:06:42.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shortly after he was born, at the age of zero,\Nhe sent his nanny flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.57,0:06:48.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course, I was surprised!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:53.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Komurasaki-sama, the most beautiful woman\Nin all of Wano, is Oden-sama's daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.41,0:06:59.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it was the Kawamatsu the Kappa\Nthat saved her from the burning castle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.33,0:07:02.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What a beautiful story of loyalty!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:08.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The samurai that protected her by disguising himself as\Na chivalrous criminal named Kyoshiro...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.42,0:07:12.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...was none other than one of the\NNine Red Scabbards, Denjiro-dono!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:17.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do you know who took down Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.93,0:07:29.44,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1713,249)}Para-\Ndise\NFarm
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.56,0:07:20.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I do! Heard it was a warrior\Nby the name of "Joyboy"!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.81,0:07:23.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seems like he's\Nalready left the country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:27.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wish I could have seen him!\NHe's a hero rivaled only by the God of the Blade!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.45,0:07:38.95,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1650,336)}Eternal\NGraves
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.95,0:07:38.95,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1649,458)}Ringo
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.50,0:07:43.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Build temples?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.63,0:07:46.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As was done for Ryuma,\Nthe God of the Blade,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.75,0:07:50.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I want to build one dedicated to Oden-sama\Nupon a hill overlooking the Flower Capital!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.59,0:07:53.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surrounding that,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.26,0:07:57.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,we will build temples dedicated to Yasuie-dono\Nand the other Daimyo that fought for our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.31,0:08:00.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.56,0:08:09.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...for Ashura and Izo as well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.17,0:08:27.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onimaru!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.84,0:08:34.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onimaru, that tickles!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.13,0:08:36.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To think you were alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.01,0:08:40.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, this brings back memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.06,0:08:43.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You, too, are a brother-in-arms,\Nhaving fought for our country.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.77,0:08:48.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose we, too, shall someday be\Nlaid to rest alongside Ashura and Izo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.90,0:08:52.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If that is fine with you, Marco-dono?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:54.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Of course, yes sirree.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.74,0:08:59.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One's home soil is best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.12,0:09:01.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's probably what Izo'd want.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.62,0:09:09.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There I go, surviving again...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.26,0:09:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As did we...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.97,0:09:20.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Had we lived through it all,\Nonly for something to befall our heroes...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.31,0:09:23.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I could not bear the thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.81,0:09:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us pray they are well.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.60,0:09:30.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So hungry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.52,0:09:33.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nay, nay, nay...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.70,0:09:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My dear brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.49,0:09:41.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yamato-kun, where are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.78,0:09:44.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffytaro-san and Zorojuro-san have...!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:50.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear brother!\NLuffytaro-san and Zorojuro-san have...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.13,0:09:56.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...awakened!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.26,0:10:04.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ever the tomboy...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.89,0:10:06.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It does not hurt though...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.85,0:10:09.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Boooooze!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.44,0:10:12.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meeeeat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.94,0:10:17.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro!\NYou have awakened!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.84,0:10:20.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! You are awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.74,0:10:24.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Luffy!\NThank goodness you did wake up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.58,0:10:26.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's way too soon for you\Nto be drinking that much!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:31.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whew, this's somethin' to celebrate!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.58,0:10:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How about we\Nget this party started?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.42,0:10:38.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come, now, you two!\NDo not eat too much yet!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:44.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The whole country was going to\Nhave a grand feast when you woke up!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.14,0:10:45.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let us have it today!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.27,0:10:59.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Tis I, Momonosuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.57,0:11:02.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hwuuuuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.49,0:11:05.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I get it!\NYou're all grown up now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.28,0:11:07.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your body's lookin' pretty strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.75,0:11:09.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Because of Oden's blood, huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.16,0:11:11.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lemme try punchin' ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.92,0:11:12.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Do not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:14.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.96,0:11:15.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are bullying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.42,0:11:17.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are bullying me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.34,0:11:22.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Nami, save me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.60,0:11:26.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Knock that off!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.06,0:11:33.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I-I am still eight years old!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.48,0:11:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It does not hurt, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.48,0:11:40.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's as tough as I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.53,0:11:45.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is the adult world, Momo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:48.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You cannot hide behind\Nthe privilege of youth anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.41,0:11:52.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.25,0:11:56.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Child on the inside,\NOden on the outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.67,0:11:58.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Stop putting a tray on my head\Nevery time you see me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:04.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Such a sturdy body!\NYou have your parents to thank for that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.51,0:12:08.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will most definitely be\Nthe greatest samurai in our country!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.81,0:12:10.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I shall persevere at that!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.69,0:12:15.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mealtime, mealtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.90,0:12:25.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.61,0:12:29.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's hit the baths before the feast!\NYour prayers were answered, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:32.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,"Prayers"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.16,0:12:37.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I heard there's a custom in Wano\Nwhere one abstains from doing something...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.04,0:12:40.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...until one's wish comes true,\Nas a form of prayer to the gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.84,0:12:43.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Until you two recovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.84,0:12:47.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I gave up eating and bathing!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.14,0:12:49.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.93,0:12:53.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Yamabro!\NI'm all better, thanks to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.14,0:12:55.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whattaguy, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.15,0:12:59.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neither of us is dirty, though...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.27,0:13:02.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wiped your bodies clean!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.61,0:13:04.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Does it please you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.28,0:13:09.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mossbrain!\NLet's talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.37,0:13:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, you...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.58,0:13:16.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But after the battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.87,0:13:19.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,if I've lost my mind...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.59,0:13:22.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,you gotta kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:26.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's right, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.05,0:13:32.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I came back\Nfrom hell to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.22,0:13:35.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah, no,\NI'm good now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.81,0:13:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's all good now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.23,0:13:41.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can't be sane\Nwith that dumb-lookin' face!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.32,0:13:44.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What'd you say, asswipe?!\NI look totally sane, no matter how ya slice it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.82,0:13:46.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Die with honor, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.61,0:13:48.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How 'bout you die, Mossbrains!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.49,0:13:50.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You told me to kill you!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.24,0:13:51.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sheesh...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:53.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Well, let's go take a bath, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.95,0:13:57.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, Nami.\NThere's no mixed bath in the castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.33,0:14:01.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Might I accompany you, Nami-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:08.34,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1669,168)}Castle\NInterior
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:08.34,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1670,346)}Rock\NBath
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.34,0:14:08.34,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(191,723)}Men's\NBath
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.39,0:14:12.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All right, bathtime!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.89,0:14:16.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ya-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.73,0:14:25.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Baths rock!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.82,0:14:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What?! A dream?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.82,0:14:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Y-Yamato! You...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.08,0:14:36.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, so refreshing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.45,0:14:39.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Being in the bath together\Nis the best!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.62,0:14:42.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We're gonna party after this!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.17,0:14:44.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's gonna be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.88,0:14:47.38,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(410,703)}Women's\NBath
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.80,0:14:50.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The men's bath is so noisy!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.80,0:14:55.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna be bewitchin' just like you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.81,0:14:57.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feels good!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.77,0:15:02.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Remember how we all used to bathe together\Nwith Oden-sama and your family!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.40,0:15:06.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Though it was quite uncomfortable for me\Nto bathe with other men...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:09.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Kiku-chan,\Nyou have not changed one bit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And now, I am older than you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.74,0:15:14.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feels good!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.53,0:15:17.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Shooo goood!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.33,0:15:20.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you hear!\NThey said the feast is today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:24.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's have another celebration!\NTo the revival of the Kozuki Clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.08,0:15:26.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let all the regions know!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:31.43,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1678,193)}Tokage\NPort
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.92,0:15:31.43,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1675,376)}Udon
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.30,0:15:35.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Managed to get 'er back\Nto her old self!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.35,0:15:37.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, she's looking seaworthy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.47,0:15:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,General Franky's all fixed up, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.81,0:15:45.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's just so cool!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.48,0:15:48.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No fraternizin', you morons!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.98,0:15:52.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't let your guard down\N'til we've left port safely!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.66,0:16:00.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Information must have leaked from somewhere\Nand reached journalists by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:05.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we're gonna be pegged as\Nreplacement Emperors of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.58,0:16:10.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He's right. This is an isolated country,\Nso people can't look in from the outside,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.46,0:16:13.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,but we can't see\Nour enemies' movements, either!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.01,0:16:18.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe our captains' bounties have shot up to\Nsomething crazy! Like, higher than any we've seen!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.85,0:16:25.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got that right! Couldn't tell ya\Nhow the info leaked, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.65,0:16:27.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.23,0:16:31.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're the source, gotta be!\NYou really piss me off, you know that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.49,0:16:36.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Those bounties you were talkin' about?\NI got 'em, right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.62,0:16:39.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wanna see 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.50,0:16:44.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They're all there!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.37,0:16:46.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your new bounties, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.79,0:16:52.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...the names of the\Nsoon-to-be-crowned Emperors of the Sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.18,0:16:58.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I told you to tell me\Nwhere the hell you are now!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.30,0:17:03.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And I told you, Sakazuki-san,\NI'm in the air!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.56,0:17:06.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In the air where?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.69,0:17:09.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, I can see Wano now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.23,0:17:14.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will not do anything stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.45,0:17:16.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Got that, Green Bull?!
